<h2>DFP EXtractoR 1.0</h2>
<p>
  Multilayer OpenEXR sequences to ProRes and PNG, with Cryptomatte matte
  extraction and light-group export — and, from this build on, the app can
  update itself.
</p>
<p>
  Fixed in this build: an export longer than about fifty frames could freeze
  part-way through, and Stop could not reach it while it was stuck. Long
  sequences now run to the end, and Stop lands within a frame of the press.
</p>
]]></description>
